    {
      "id": "6dc4acf3-ee96-49de-8fe0-6701e844b5ac",
      "name": "Sticky Note 81ec4c53",
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "content": "## #8 Invoice Follow Up (demo: Summit Ridge Roofing)\nEvery morning at 9: reads unpaid invoices from the **Demo Invoices Summit Ridge Roofing** data table, works out days overdue, and sends the next reminder in a 7 / 14 / 21 / 28 / 35 / 42 day sequence. It tracks the last stage sent, so a missed day never causes a skipped or double reminder. At 42 days the status flips to needs_call so the owner steps in."
      },
